      "filename": "DGJ 1646 - They had company so I couldn't go in for tea... (3492741086).jpg",
      "title": "File:DGJ 1646 - They had company so I couldn't go in for tea... (3492741086).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/94/DGJ_1646_-_They_had_company_so_I_couldn%27t_go_in_for_tea..._%283492741086%29.jpg",
